civetweb
------------------------------------------
Project mission is to provide easy to use, powerful, C (C/C++) embeddable web
server with optional CGI, SSL and Lua support. CivetWeb has a MIT license so
you can innovate without restrictions.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libcivetweb-cpp-devel-1.16-1bl3
  libcivetweb-cpp1.16.0-1.16-1bl3
  libcivetweb-devel-1.16-1bl3
  libcivetweb1.16.0-1.16-1bl3
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libssl3-3.5.9-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1
  zlib0-1.4-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libssl-devel-3.5.9-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1
  zlib-devel-1.4-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/civetweb/civetweb

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/civetweb/civetweb/archive/refs/tags/v1.16.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack civetweb-1.16-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./civetweb-1.16-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/civetweb-1.16-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/civetweb-1.16-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libcivetweb1.16.0-1.16-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libcivetweb-devel-1.16-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libcivetweb-cpp1.16.0-1.16-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libcivetweb-cpp-devel-1.16-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(civetweb)
  /usr/bin/civetweb.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/civetweb.README
  /usr/share/doc/civetweb/CREDITS.md
  /usr/share/doc/civetweb/LICENSE.md
  /usr/share/doc/civetweb/README.md
  /usr/share/doc/civetweb/RELEASE_NOTES.md
  /usr/share/doc/civetweb/SECURITY.md

(libcivetweb1.16.0)
  /usr/bin/cygcivetweb-1.16.0.dll

(libcivetweb-devel)
  /usr/include/civetweb.h
  /usr/lib/cmake/civetweb/FindLibDl.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/civetweb/FindLibRt.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/civetweb/FindWinSock.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/civetweb/civetweb-config-version.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/civetweb/civetweb-config.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/civetweb/civetweb-targets-relwithdebinfo.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/civetweb/civetweb-targets.cmake
  /usr/lib/libcivetweb.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/civetweb.pc

(libcivetweb-cpp1.16.0)
  /usr/bin/cygcivetweb-cpp-1.16.0.dll

(libcivetweb-cpp-devel)
  /usr/include/CivetServer.h
  /usr/lib/libcivetweb-cpp.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/civetweb-cpp.pc

